SRC/diff -- changes made for the OSK freeware collection  os9.c    c_modtime(), the OS-9 stand-in for ctime() in the `diff -c'           header, left out the newline ctime()'s string ends with, so the           `***' and `---' headers ran together on one line and patch could           not read them.  It also printed the year as the raw byte (126           for 2026) and the hour and minute unpadded (9:1 PM).  It now           writes 2026/09/26 21:01 and a newline.  Rebuilt -qm with the           recipe in tools/rebuild/recipes.psv, 2026-09-26.  The original           is os9.c.ori.